Demons have a chance of gating in another demon, including a small
chance of a demon prince, which will be one of two nasty guys:
Yeenoghu and Juiblex.  Juiblex is marginally handleable at that level
with the right equipment*, but Yeenoghu is a tough cookie.  Both
respect 'E', which is probably part of the best plan for facing early,
angry demon princes (aka run like hell, usually downward so you can
get better equipment to face them on the way back up).

* Something to cure sickness, preferably repeatably.



